<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 32px 24px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23">Hello Team,</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #2E4A66;padding:0 0 0 16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">A bit overloaded with every integration going on, but it&#x27;s already in my radar to add a tabbing section to <a href="https://command.synergylenders.com/library" style="color:#2E4A66;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:#AFC0D1;font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:normal">https://command.synergylenders.com/library</a> for a dedicated prompts section. Currently only photo upload is working, but the prompts tab will be live next week with integration guides for G Suite and Fathom.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#E5F6EA" style="background-color:#E5F6EA;border-left:3px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">If you context dump me on what you&#x27;d like to do with Claude, I&#x27;m one WhatsApp knock away. I&#x27;ll try my level best, with whatever experience I&#x27;ve got, to turn it into optimized prompts. I&#x27;m always researching MCPs too, so I&#x27;ll point you to the right ones, along with the optimal tier to get everyone onboarded in one shot.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FBF4E2" style="background-color:#FBF4E2;border-left:3px solid #8A6414;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">On the side, I&#x27;ll try my best to create some content and blog posts for the team&#x27;s perusal. Given the workload, I can&#x27;t commit a hard deadline, but I&#x27;ll get it done.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 0 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding-top:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#4F575E">Your friendly neighbourhood Claude Goblin,</p><p style="margin:8px 0 0 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Shadrian</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"></td></tr>
